TODAY(1)				RCIS BBS UTILITIES				TODAY(1)NAME	today - list events in history for the daySYNOPSIS	todayDESCRIPTION	today will display historical events, famous birthdays, etc. that	occurred on the day that Today is run.  Today will write its output	to standard I/O using MSGList color codes.  This utility is intended	to be run by rCron once a day, and for its output to be re-directed	to a file that can be listed by loginprogs, or elsewhere on the BBS.SEE ALSO	rcron(1), /dd/datafiles/today.*, loginprogs(1)